# Line endings (FOUND-006, #8): every text file is stored and checked out with LF on every
# platform, so Windows checkouts produce no spurious CRLF diffs, and Prettier (endOfLine "lf") and
# the shell hooks under .husky/ keep working. Git detects binary files itself; the list below makes
# the common ones explicit so they are never normalised.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
